From: Jason Rhinelander <jason@imaginary.ca>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:54:38 -0400
Subject: Include the libquic headers each file uses

libquic 1.14 drops the oxen/quic.hpp umbrella header, so the files that
included it, and the ones that only compiled through what it pulled in,
now include the libquic, oxenc and standard headers they use directly.

These are the source changes of Morgan Pretty's a12da176 on dev,
without its session-router submodule bump, for building 1.9.4 against
a system libquic 1.14.
---
